WEBVTT

00:18:29.417 --> 00:18:32.726
I think people are really
interested in your thoughts

00:18:32.750 --> 00:18:35.351
on the United States health care system.

00:18:35.375 --> 00:18:38.934
We have so many underinsured
and uninsured people

00:18:38.958 --> 00:18:42.809
and the changes that you might
make to that system,

00:18:42.833 --> 00:18:45.018
I mean, does that situation
make things worse,

00:18:45.042 --> 00:18:47.684
and what changes
would you make to the system

00:18:47.708 --> 00:18:50.500
so that we're not
as vulnerable in the future?

00:18:51.576 --> 00:18:53.434
DA: So that's a great set of questions,

00:18:53.458 --> 00:18:57.684
and so just from the point of view
of the testing program,

00:18:57.708 --> 00:19:01.226
it is absolutely critical
that the testing be free.